    "text": "Here, magnetic moment due to loop&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iA</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i&#960;r</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.20</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.28</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math><br /><br />Similarly magnetic moment due to loop-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iA</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>i&#960;r</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#960;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.30</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.63</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math><br /><br />Net magnetic moment<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.63</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.28</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;